title: Support
---
body:

<section>
  <h2>Documentation</h2>
  <p>Read the <a href="https://cinemagoer.readthedocs.io/">online documentation</a>.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Bugs and improvements</h2>
  <p>You can use the <a href="https://github.com/cinemagoer/cinemagoer/issues">GitHub issues page</a> to notify bugs and suggest improvements.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Discussion</h2>
  <p>You can use the <a href="https://github.com/cinemagoer/cinemagoer/discussions">GitHub discussion page</a> for broader discussions.</p>
</section>
